      "@id": "kt:aws-partitions",
      "@type": "kto:InfrastructureConcept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "AWS partitions",
      "skos:definition": "A partition is a group of AWS Regions with its own independent IAM instance, accounts and control plane; every Region and every account belongs to exactly one partition (aws, aws-cn, aws-us-gov, aws-eusc), and partitions form a hard boundary that credentials and most cross-Region features cannot cross.",
